WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.620
Every headline

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.060
calls it

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:01.780
a breakout,

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:02.500
but read

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.140
OpenAI's

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:03.800
own report,

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:04.460
and the scary

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:05.100
part is

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.000
somewhere else.
